    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Il me semble que",
     "texto": [
      "**Il me semble que** (it seems to me that) introduces a soft opinion, with the indicative: **Il me semble que tu as raison** (it seems to me that you are right)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "À mon sens, quant à",
     "texto": [
      "**À mon sens** (in my view), **quant à** (as for): **Quant à moi, je suis d'accord** (as for me, I agree)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "En définitive, au fond",
     "texto": [
      "**En définitive** (ultimately) and **au fond** (deep down) close the opinion: **En définitive, on part demain** (ultimately, we leave tomorrow)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
